  "title": {
   "en": "Maou No Aisai Wa Aisarenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "魔王の愛妻は愛されない"
   },
   {
    "en": "The demon king's wife"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where humans and demons are in an endless war... One day, the demon king, Gil, arrives in the Kingdom of Hazelbard, a large human territory. Gil proposes a \"truce\" to the humans on the condition that neither side will invade the other's territory. However, due to a scheme by the queen, who is also his stepmother, to credit the agreement to her son Clemon, Princess Estelle is forced to marry the demon king in exchange...\n\n(Source: Cmoa, translated)",
   "ja": "人間と魔族が絶えない争いを繰り返している世界…人間領土の大国・ハゼルバート王国に、ある日魔族の王「ギル」がやってきた。ギルは互いの領土への不可侵を条件に人間に対し「休戦」を申し出る。しかし協定を我が子クレモンの功績にしたい継母である王妃の策略で、王女エステルは交換条件として魔族の王へ嫁ぐことになり……。"
  },
